            </note>
            <note corresp="#d556-f2" n="36" xml:id="d556-f2-content">
                <p>The chief delegate for the Soviet Union was Arkady Alexandrovich Sobolev,
                    Secretary General of the People’s Commissariat for Foreign Affairs.</p>
            </note>
